# Dusk Rose Reliquary exiles a Treasure token Bot2 made (CR 610.3, 111.7): a token that leaves the battlefield ceases to exist, so when Bot1 later
# Disenchants the Reliquary nothing comes back (the card's ruling). Bot2 on turn 2 casts Deadly Dispute, sacrificing an Ornithopter for a Treasure
# token and two cards; on turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices its Healer's Hawk to cast the Reliquary, which can exile the Treasure or the Mox Jet - Bot1 chooses
# the Treasure. The Mox Jet is still on the battlefield afterwards, the Treasure nowhere.

